811.9;+301,;.01~VA-BL NSG SUBQ ON ADMISSION
811.9;+301,;1.2~Subq Lines on Admission
811.9;+301,;2~WP-start~5
This reminder defintion will look at the current date and time and 
compare to the admission date and time of an inpatient, it will be DUE 
NOW if the patient is an inpatient and the current fileman date and time 
is not greater than 24 hours from admission.  It will be resolved if 
Subcutaneous line on admission has been addressed.
